    "text": "I, Ediriweera Weerawardena, the Minister of the Ministry of Road Development, Transport, Power and Energy and Housingand Construction of the Central Province Provincial Council, hereby announce that the following member of the boardof directors appointed through the Extraordinary Gazette No. 1833/ 3 on 21.10.2013 as per the powers vested on meby the 6 (a) and 6 (e) clauses in the Central Provincial Passenger Transport Services Authority Statute No. 01 of 2000 isremoved from the post of Chairman/ Member of The Board of Directors of Central Province Provincial PassengerTransport Services Authority, as per the powers vested on me by the 12 th clause of the same statute.",
